# Accessibility

## UI Accessibility
- Support screen readers
- Use semantic widgets
- Provide proper contrast
- Support different text sizes
- Use proper heading hierarchy
- Implement keyboard navigation
- Support voice control

## Screen Reader Support
- Use proper labels
- Provide alt text for images
- Use semantic HTML
- Implement ARIA attributes
- Provide proper descriptions
- Support screen reader navigation
- Test with screen readers

## Keyboard Navigation
- Support keyboard shortcuts
- Implement proper focus management
- Provide keyboard alternatives
- Follow accessibility guidelines
- Support tab navigation
- Handle focus traps
- Test keyboard navigation

## Visual Accessibility
- Use proper color contrast
- Support high contrast mode
- Provide text alternatives
- Use appropriate font sizes
- Support zoom functionality
- Handle reduced motion
- Test visual accessibility

## Cognitive Accessibility
- Use clear language
- Provide clear instructions
- Use consistent navigation
- Support different reading levels
- Provide clear feedback
- Use appropriate timing
- Test cognitive accessibility

## Accessibility Testing
- Test with screen readers
- Test keyboard navigation
- Test color contrast
- Test with different text sizes
- Test with different devices
- Test with different users
- Document accessibility testing
